<script setup lang="ts">import { ref } from 'vue'; const dishes=ref([{name:'番茄牛腩',tag:'炖菜',ingredients:'牛腩、番茄、土豆',wanted:true},{name:'蒜蓉西兰花',tag:'炒菜',ingredients:'西兰花、蒜、蚝油',wanted:false},{name:'海鲜粥',tag:'主食',ingredients:'大米、虾、姜丝',wanted:false}]); function toggle(index:number){dishes.value[index].wanted=!dishes.value[index].wanted}</script>
<template><view class="page"><view class="heading"><text class="label">今天吃什么</text><text class="title">想吃的，都点上</text><text class="subtitle">两个人的选择会汇总为一份待做菜单</text></view><view v-for="(dish,index) in dishes" :key="dish.name" class="dish" @tap="toggle(index)"><view class="dish-icon">{{ dish.tag==='主食'?'🍚':dish.tag==='炒菜'?'🥬':'🍲' }}</view><view><text class="dish-name">{{dish.name}}</text><text class="ingredient">{{dish.ingredients}}</text></view><view class="want" :class="{active:dish.wanted}">{{dish.wanted?'已想吃':'想吃'}}</view></view><view class="summary">待做菜单：{{ dishes.filter((dish)=>dish.wanted).length }} 道　·　点菜后可一键查看缺少食材</view></view></template>
